ception ` upon discovering undeclared type variables as it was recently fixed on the JVM. \\n> \\n\\n> \\n> ###  16\\\\. August 2024: version 1.14.19 \\n> \\n>   * <::marker>Add Maven Mojo for transforming jars and for transforming dependencies folder. \\n>   * <::marker>Better error handling for unresolved type variables. \\n>   * <::marker>Allow loading arguments of the instrumented method in ` MemberSubstitution ` . \\n>   * <::marker>Fix checks for method visibility. \\n> \\n\\n\\n<::marker>Commits \\n\\n  * <::marker> [ ` 7047adb ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/7047adb489f94354674740acc193a990839d513c) [maven-release-plugin] prepare release byte-buddy-1.15.0 \\n  * <::marker> [ ` 6d05733 ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/6d05733343d7275dc52aec693c59a42fd30d6757) [release] Release new version \\n  * <::marker> [ ` 28472f9 ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/28472f908277ea204604922fbc3e2f9417559b0c) Add missing javadoc. \\n  * <::marker> [ ` 16a83a4 ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/16a83a47412b49ddcdbbaf0d076ecab30ee8fe88) Remove use of raw type. \\n  * <::marker> [ ` d94182e ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/d94182eb78df72524a878fcda625217e96d08f0a) Removing one raw type warning from ByteBuddyAndroidPlugin ( [ #1702 ](https://redirect.github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/issues/1702) ) \\n  * <::marker> [ ` 98bb6cd ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/98bb6cd72575b50f0c7afe6ec3c376dc9dcb9c66) Make build work again. \\n  * <::marker> [ ` 7e87eca ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/7e87eca168c5c6a4f96a2e06e4eeb1157dfec3a9) Use reflection and translation to piggy back Android task on top of regular G... \\n  * <::marker> [ ` c5507cc ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/c5507cc89ce1368a808b514a0382c0934a1c7805) Avoid duplication og Gradle plugin logic. \\n  * <::marker> [ ` d11652d ` ](https://github.com/raphw/byte-buddy/commit/d11652d2062afa74597dfa0e9df7028a5d5d6026) Merge bran