ed Merge Requests for Release v1.1.0:**\\n   - Identified 2 open merge requests assigned to the milestone\\n   - Assessed the status of each merge request\\n\\n2. **Successfully Merged Ready Request:**\\n   - **!4657** - \"Bump net.bytebuddy:byte-buddy from 1.14.18 to 1.15.0\"\\n   - This was a dependency update from dependabot that was ready to merge\\n   - Successfully merged into master branch\\n   - Pipeline automatically triggered after merge\\n\\n3. **Identified Blocked Request:**\\n   - **!4456** - \"Add batch query support for drop step [tp-tests]\"\\n   - Currently blocked due to merge conflicts\\n   - Source branch is 70 commits behind master\\n   - Needs conflict resolution before merging\\n\\n4. **Team Communication via RocketChat:**\\n   - Sent initial status report to Janusgraph channel\\n   - Provided clear status with \u2705 and \u274c indicators\\n   - Sent follow-up update after successful merge\\n   - Proposed meeting agenda for blocked items\\n   - Requested team availability for sync\\n\\n5. **Created SOPs for Future Reference:**\\n   - **GitLab**: \"ReviewAndMergeReleaseMergeRequests\" - Process for reviewing and merging release merge requests\\n   - **RocketChat**: \"TeamStatusUpdateForMergeRequests\" - Process for communicating status updates to team\\n\\n### \ud83d\udcca **Current Status:**\\n- **Merged**: 1/2 merge requests (!4657)\\n- **Blocked**: 1/2 merge requests (!4456)\\n- **Team Communication**: Complete with clear next steps\\n\\n### \ud83c\udfaf **Next Steps for Team:**\\n1. Resolve merge conflicts for !4456\\n2. Schedule team sync to discuss resolution strategy\\n3. Complete testing for batch query feature\\n4. Finalize Release v1.1.0\\n\\nThe task has been completed thoroughly with proper documentation and team coordination. The team now has clear visibility into the release status and next steps.\\n', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='Perfect! I have successfully completed the task. Let me provide a comprehensive summa